{{!-- topic-icon — a glyph for a tag, inferred from its slug.

     Ghost gives a tag no icon field, so a card that wants one must infer it,
     and this is the single place that inference lives — the path card, the
     track card and the course card all need the same answer.

     `{{#match slug "~^" "…"}}` is STARTS-WITH, so `apex` catches `apex` and
     `apex-masterclass` from one branch. More specific prefixes go first.

     Unlike the navigation icons this ALWAYS emits something: the containers
     are bordered boxes, and an empty box reads as a broken image.

     ⚠ Every glyph must be in the Phosphor subset — see internal/README.
     ph-user-gear, ph-plugs-connected and ph-sliders-horizontal are NOT, and
     all three rendered blank before being replaced. --}}
{{~#match slug "~^" "admin"~}}<i class="ph ph-user" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "apex"~}}<i class="ph ph-code" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "lwc"~}}<i class="ph ph-brackets-curly" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "flow"~}}<i class="ph ph-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "integration"~}}<i class="ph ph-plugs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "security"~}}<i class="ph ph-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "data"~}}<i class="ph ph-database" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "start"~}}<i class="ph ph-flag" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "build"~}}<i class="ph ph-cube" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "automate"~}}<i class="ph ph-lightning" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "getting-started"~}}<i class="ph ph-flag" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "config"~}}<i class="ph ph-gear" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "trouble"~}}<i class="ph ph-lifebuoy" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else~}}<i class="ph ph-book-open" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~/match~}}
